WEBVTT

00:00:03.264 --> 00:00:04.951
I’<b>m not</b> American.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.663
She <b>isn’t</b> from London.

00:00:08.596 --> 00:00:10.471
They <b>aren’t</b> Spanish.

00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:13.573
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Are</b> you Turkish?

00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:15.648
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I <b>am</b>.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:18.833
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Is</b> she Russian?

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:21.099
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, she <b>isn’t</b>.

00:00:22.794 --> 00:00:24.718
<b>Are</b> we in class 2?

00:00:25.365 --> 00:00:27.045
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, we <b>aren’t</b>.